# Build output
/todobem
/todobem.exe
/dump
/dist/
*.test
*.out
*.prof
coverage.*

# Session logs are private conversations — never commit them (a synthetic fixture needs `git add -f`)
*.jsonl

# Local scratch; `cmd/dump <id> export.json` writes a full model with verbatim user messages
/export*.json
*.log

# Validation reports quote real sessions verbatim; they stay local (the protocol: docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §11)
/docs/validation-reports/
# Russian draft of the architecture; the public document is docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
/docs/ARCHITECTURE.html

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Claude Code local overrides
.claude/settings.local.json

# deploy.sh runtime artifacts and the derived session cache (safe to delete)
/todobem.pid
/todobem-agent.pid
/todobem.out
/todobem-agent.out
/.todobem

# Local idea notes (never committed): the TODO file and the Insights brainstorm folder — expert
# briefs, plans, critiques and their corpus numbers; the decisions they led to are recorded in
# docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §13
/TODO.md
/docs/brainstorm/

# Scratch that lands in the tree by accident: screenshots and stray files dropped in the root,
# machine output of review / fix tools (the human-readable REVIEW*.md records stay tracked)
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/--*
/docs/*.json
/docs/*.jsonl
/docs/*.txt
/docs/*.log
